    "probe_text": "Confirmed against source. Here is the complete ordered list for `POST /api/owners` (handled by `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`, lines 646\u2013691).\n\n## Validations & side-effects, in execution order\n\n**Before the method body runs:**\n1. **Security check** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")`. Rejects callers without the `OWNER_ADMIN` role.\n2. **Bean Validation on the request DTO** (`@Valid @RequestBody OwnerFieldsDto`) \u2014 JSR-380 constraints from `openapi.yml`:\n   - `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,30)`, `@Pattern` (letters, up to 3 words, apostrophe/hyphen separators)\n   - `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,30)`, `@Pattern` (like firstName, optional trailing `.`)\n   - `address` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,255)`\n   - `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,80)`\n   - `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,20)`\n   - `email` \u2014 `@Email`, `@Size(1,255)` (optional)\n   - `postcode` \u2014 `@Pattern(\"^[0-9]{4}$\")` (optional)\n\n**Inside the method body (in order):**\n\n| # | Step | Kind | Line |\n|---|------|------|------|\n| 3 | `normalizeAddress` \u2014 trim, collapse whitespace, upper-case, expand ST\u2192STREET / RD\u2192ROAD / AVE\u2192AVENUE; **mutates DTO** | side-effect | 649 |\n| 4 | `validateRequiredFields` \u2014 reject blank firstName/lastName/address/city/telephone \u2192 `RequiredFieldsMissingException` | validation | 650 |\n| 5 | `registrationDate` default \u2014 if null, set to `LocalDate.now()` | side-effect | 651\u2013653 |\n| 6 | Future-date check \u2014 if `registrationDate` after today \u2192 `FutureRegistrationDateException` | validation | 654\u2013657 |\n| 7 | `toBusinessDay` \u2014 roll Sat/Sun forward to Monday; **mutates DTO** | side-effect | 658\u2013659 |\n| 8 | `rejectDailyOwnerLimit` \u2014 **DB read**; \u2265100 owners on that date \u2192 `DailyOwnerLimitExceededException` | validation (DB) | 660 |\n| 9 | `rejectCityAtCapacity` \u2014 **DB read**; \u226550 owners in that cit